  "conditions": [
    "status is the only request permitted to omit runtime. A supplied runtime must match every response, including negative responses.",
    "layout perimeter requires satellites integer0..8. Every other layout forbids satellites. CLI supplies default8.",
    "audio policy slot requires all3 slot binding fields. follows_focus and muted forbid all3. Null slot input is invalid.",
    "profile is an opaque saved authority ID, never a numeric profile number. Optional filters do not activate a global provider.",
    "All objects are closed; reject duplicate keys at every depth, malformed Unicode, nonfinite numbers and noncanonical integer spellings.",
    "Binding in every response is exactly request params minus version,runtime,op; compare decoded objects, not serialized key order.",
    "Negative results contain only version,runtime,op,binding,reason. unsupported status requires reason unsupported; rejected excludes unsupported. No fresh context/ticket.",
    "Successful status contains only common fields plus snapshot; sources plus items,cursor,complete; mutations plus accepted:true,outcome requested|applied.",
    "Source page tickets and source_ids are unique. complete means cursor is null; incomplete means a nonempty opaque cursor. Labels and queries exclude control/format characters, URLs, path-like strings and credential assignments.",
    "Snapshot slots are unique and contiguous0..count-1. off:0,single:1,pip:2,grid4:4,grid9:9,perimeter:satellites+1. Satellites is0 exceptperimeter.",
    "Snapshot off has focus_slot/audio_slot null and audio_policy muted; otherwise focus_slot names an existing slot. Non-null audio_slot names an existing slot; muted requires null; follows_focus permits null or focus_slot.",
    "Snapshot source has exactly source_id,label,provider,profile,kind; never a ticket, URI or secret. Source can be null. failed requires a closed error; other states permit null or a closed error without inventing playback proof.",
    "Capabilities are closed; unique subsets of enums; status mandatory. max_slots0 permits only status with allotherlists empty. Positive capacity bounds every advertised fixed layout; perimeter requires1 slot minimum and each CLI request checks satellites+1<=max_slots.",
    "A capability advertising layout requires nonempty layouts; play/sources require nonempty source_kinds; audio requires nonempty audio_policies; off requires nonempty off_modes. No marker is manufactured by controller.",
    "Runtime and scene are non-reused incarnation identities. All revisions are opaque non-reused tokens within their incarnation. Original Invocation retains deadline and request ID; existing Delivery handles duplicates.",
    "Receipt requested/applied describes the operation only, never simultaneous decoded frames, visible playback or current state. Native rechecks policy/admission and context immediately before effects.",
    "Source tokens and cursors cannot be broadcast across players. Full inactive provider catalog and Plex broker support are not implied by sources; only advertised/native-authorized snapshot choices are valid.",
    "Geometry is generated once by native and transferred privately to backend as exact even pixel rectangles. Public CLI has no arbitrary rectangle or HLS URI fields.",
    "source_id uses token grammar1..64; ticket and cursor use ticket grammar1..256. Provider and profile are nonempty strings, never null; profile is a saved authority identity even for Local sources.",
    "Query may be empty; label must be nonblank. Both exclude controls, formatting characters, malformed Unicode and private URL/path/credential patterns.",
    "Snapshot slot order is immaterial. Resolve by slot_id, never by array position. source must be nonnull for starting,playing,paused,stalled. paused represents intentional suspension, not stalled or stopped playback.",
    "Snapshot error is null or a STRING from reasons, not an open error object. failed requires a reason string.",
    "audio_policy slot requires nonnull audio_slot naming an existing slot. audio_slot is the configured owner, not proof of audible samples."
  ],
